/**
 * NYUCHI DESIGN TOKENS — N1: The Mathematical Substrate
 *
 * Canonical source: mzizi.dev
 * W3C Design Tokens Specification (2025.10) compliant
 * Nyuchi Frontend Architecture — Vertical Node N1
