/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   NYUCHI SUITABILITY CARD — Layer 3 Brand Component (Pre-Wired)

   Scored recommendation card with mineral color mapping.
   ✅ HARNESS  ✅ TOKENS  ✅ ARIA  ✅ LOADING  ✅ MOTION
